  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🔪 传说中有许多猪灵入侵了主世界，你可以找到由那场战争留下的、外形独特的废墟。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🦴 探索遗迹：在探索中发现并收集猪灵过往的遗留物品，战利品包括：黑曜石、带雕饰的盔甲、武器，使用刷子清理砾石，还能获得更珍贵的物品，如自定义旗帜、药水、怪物头颅、陶片等。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#c9f\"><strong>兼容世界生成数据包，同样适用于 Paper/Spigot。（请确保提前准备备份，因为 Paper 有时会出错）<br></strong></span><strong>报告 bug、提供反馈或参与开发，我们有一个<a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fCZQthZJjPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>，大家都能在这里交流！</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/949138580415062017?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/632624?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">兼容性</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msMOOMq.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hIpLSyga/images/21e58ce2208b2d3a3b8c513156d5605695883245.png\" alt=\"缩略图\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IlBNUql.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3oSlucE.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A5UqBQi.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/H9WJK65dKjo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h3>如果你打算开始一段冒险，结账时使用优惠码 'HOPONO' 可享首月八折优惠！❤️</h3>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fhopono\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/hopono</a></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CZQthZJjPc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png&n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"50\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hopo-better-rui